{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國地質調查局（USGS）10月16日指，俄羅斯堪察加半島（Kamchatka Peninsula）發生6.9級地震， 歐洲地中海地震中心（EMSC）則表示，今次地震強度為7級。</p><p>USGS的數據顯示，震央位於俄羅斯堪察加半島城鎮Ozernovskiy東北76公里，震源深度143公里。</p><p>日本氣象廳一度誤報地震規模為9.9級，但其後已經取消有關警報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T03:59:08.554648+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:55:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T03:57:37.807190+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T03:57:37.807190+00:00","content_hash":"e35f87cfd00821dbc44b08d62dbccb08181d824a5b6b359fadaeb54cca089f47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}